  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-Nigeria Energy Diplomacy Support Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&#xd8; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Global objective &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The global objective of the EU-Nigeria Energy Diplomacy Support Project is to support Nigeria&#xbf;s efforts towards achieving its energy transition target.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xd8; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Specific objective(s)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(i)Facilitate knowledge transfer/capacity building activities in support of the Department of Renewable Energy and Rural Power Access and other relevant agencies under the Ministry&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(ii)Facilitate monitoring of EU funded&amp;nbsp;energy access projects by Department of Renewable Energy and Rural Power Access&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(iii)Facilitate collection of primary data for the power sector and studies conducted/led by the Ministry of Power, its MDAs that will help track Nigeria&#xbf;s progress towards achieving its energy transition target.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(iv)&amp;nbsp;Facilitate the review of existing policies, regulations and action plans or the drafting of new ones as may be required&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(v)Facilitate Embedded advisory support Nigerian Electricity Regulatory Commission (NERC)&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
